      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "After consultation with Mayor Vincent R. Impellitteri by telephone at Miami Beach and in line with the action taken in his executive memorandum No. 27 on November 17, 1952, which action was confirmed by the Board of Estimate in Calendar No. 8 dated December 18, 1952, I have issued the following executive memorandum:",
